WEBVTT

00:13.460 --> 00:15.800
Yeah, it definitely needs this.

00:15.800 --> 00:17.560
It's a commander type, after all.

00:17.560 --> 00:21.620
Monica, there's something I want you 
to add to the design of Night Baron.

00:21.620 --> 00:24.070
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:24.070 --> 00:26.460
I'll have it done in a jiffy.

00:26.770 --> 00:30.300
<i>Master, sorry to bother you while you're busy.</i>

00:30.970 --> 00:33.600
<i>You have a guest at the castle.</i>

00:33.600 --> 00:35.250
<i>A guest? Who is it?</i>

00:35.250 --> 00:38.510
<i>Well, it's someone claiming 
she's your older sister.</i>

00:38.510 --> 00:39.790
<i>Older sister?</i>

00:39.790 --> 00:41.900
<i>I don't have an older sister.</i>

00:41.900 --> 00:42.910
<i>What does she look like?</i>

00:42.910 --> 00:46.740
<i>She has pink hair and looks 
about five years older than you...</i>

00:46.740 --> 00:48.580
<i>Hey! Wh-What are you—</i>

00:48.580 --> 00:51.570
<i>What's this, Kohaku? Are you 
telepathically talking to someone?</i>

00:51.570 --> 00:53.560
<i>Wait, that voice...</i>

00:53.560 --> 00:56.630
<i>Let me talk to Touya, too.</i>

00:56.630 --> 00:59.930
<i>Hello, can you hear me?</i>

00:59.930 --> 01:02.360
Th-The Goddess of Love?!

01:03.770 --> 01:07.850
Gather up your tears

01:07.850 --> 01:10.250
And release your unhindered light

01:10.250 --> 01:15.180
That shines like a diamond

01:15.180 --> 01:16.690
Don't worry, don't care

01:16.690 --> 01:19.730
Follow your heart

01:30.520 --> 01:36.780
Every time I spoke of my
dreams, they felt closed off

01:36.780 --> 01:43.090
Even that bird and that sky
seemed monochrome to me

01:43.090 --> 01:49.540
Yet you were there in my path,
your eyes brimming with strength

01:49.540 --> 01:56.220
Time then stopped, and deep within
my heart something began to stir

01:58.290 --> 02:02.300
Don't be afraid, and run forth

02:02.300 --> 02:04.670
If we only have one life to live

02:04.670 --> 02:10.980
Then be true to yourself,
so you don't regret it

02:10.980 --> 02:15.070
Gather up your tears

02:15.070 --> 02:17.450
And release your unhindered light

02:17.450 --> 02:22.470
That shines like a diamond

02:22.470 --> 02:23.940
Don't worry, don't care

02:23.940 --> 02:27.090
Follow your heart

02:33.000 --> 02:38.010
Episode 11

02:33.000 --> 02:38.010
Sister From Another World and a Sparkling First Love

02:38.010 --> 02:41.840
I'm Touya's older sister, Mochizuki Karen.

02:41.840 --> 02:43.430
Older sister...

02:43.800 --> 02:44.730
That's right.

02:44.730 --> 02:46.150
Hey, come on—

02:46.150 --> 02:49.260
I'm happy to see him again after so long!

02:49.260 --> 02:50.270
I just want to hug him!

02:50.270 --> 02:51.980
You get along well.

02:51.980 --> 02:56.070
There must have been some situation 
that forced you two apart.

02:53.740 --> 02:56.070
Hug him!

02:56.090 --> 02:58.940
It's a heartfelt reunion.

02:58.940 --> 03:00.480
Sister-in-Law.

03:00.910 --> 03:04.370
It wouldn't be nice for us to 
interfere with your family time,

03:04.370 --> 03:06.930
so we'll take our leave for now.

03:08.250 --> 03:10.710
Thank you for your consideration!

03:12.610 --> 03:13.580
So?

03:13.580 --> 03:15.930
What in the world are you doing here?

03:15.930 --> 03:19.910
Why have you descended to the surface 
of this world, Goddess of Love?

03:19.910 --> 03:21.520
For a vacation.

03:21.520 --> 03:22.340
A vacation?

03:22.730 --> 03:26.490
Touya, you're surrounded by lots of love.

03:26.490 --> 03:31.020
So just peeking in has been enough 
to refresh my body and spirit,

03:31.020 --> 03:34.300
but lately my shoulders 
have been getting a bit stiff.

03:34.300 --> 03:35.310
Huh?

03:35.310 --> 03:39.750
So I thought I'd stay beside you 
and soak in that love power directly

03:39.750 --> 03:42.250
to fix my stiff shoulders!

03:42.250 --> 03:44.760
I'm not some power spot for you.

03:44.760 --> 03:49.560
I only just got here, and my shoulders 
are already feeling lighter.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.830
So why did you claim to be my older sister?

03:51.830 --> 03:54.520
That was just a spur-of-the-moment idea.

03:54.520 --> 03:56.300
Sparkle, sparkle, sparkle!

03:56.830 --> 04:00.100
Anyway, that's why I'll be 
staying with you for a while.

04:00.100 --> 04:00.960
Huh?

04:00.960 --> 04:02.600
Uh, well...

04:03.830 --> 04:04.930
Yes?

04:04.930 --> 04:06.840
Do you have a moment, Your Royal Highness?

04:08.280 --> 04:14.310
A messenger from the Knight Kingdom of Lestia 
arrived to see you roughly an hour ago.

04:14.310 --> 04:16.820
The Knight Kingdom of Lestia?

04:16.820 --> 04:19.290
The nation where you 
rescued Princess Hildegard

04:19.290 --> 04:21.160
when she was being attacked by the Phrase.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.650
You were watching that, too?

04:22.650 --> 04:24.530
Of course.

04:24.530 --> 04:26.880
Why do you look so smug about that?

04:27.300 --> 04:29.550
Oh, sorry, Lapis-san.

04:29.550 --> 04:31.830
So about that messenger...

04:31.830 --> 04:33.000
Well...

04:33.000 --> 04:36.490
When I asked them to wait for 
a while since you were absent,

04:36.490 --> 04:39.380
they said they wanted to 
watch the knights' training.

04:39.380 --> 04:42.590
Huh. As expected from a kingdom of knights.

04:42.590 --> 04:45.090
I suppose they'd be curious about 
other nations' knights, too.

04:45.090 --> 04:47.620
It's not just the knights 
they're curious about.

04:47.620 --> 04:48.390
Huh?

04:49.460 --> 04:51.220
Wait, what's that smile for?

04:51.220 --> 04:53.450
It's a secret.

05:04.730 --> 05:06.320
Princess Hildegard?!

05:09.430 --> 05:11.250
It's been a while, Your Royal Highness!

05:11.250 --> 05:13.750
Oh, yes, it has been.

05:13.750 --> 05:16.120
But what are you doing here?

05:16.120 --> 05:19.210
Oh, I'm here as an escort.

05:19.210 --> 05:21.800
An escort for whom?

05:21.800 --> 05:23.300
For me.

05:23.800 --> 05:25.730
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

05:25.730 --> 05:28.800
I am Galen Yunas Lestia,

05:29.210 --> 05:32.140
the previous king of the 
Knight Kingdom of Lestia,

05:32.140 --> 05:35.840
and an adventurer of the highest rank, 
just like Your Royal Highness.

05:35.840 --> 05:37.030
Thank you for the introduction.

05:37.030 --> 05:39.690
I'm the Grand Duke of Brunhild, 
Mochizuki Touya.

05:40.000 --> 05:44.220
You have my gratitude for the impressive 
gift you offered the other day.

05:44.220 --> 05:49.030
I came to thank you for that and 
do some sightseeing in Brunhild.

05:49.030 --> 05:50.840
Well, thank you.

05:50.840 --> 05:53.590
There's not very much to see here,

05:53.590 --> 05:56.020
but I hope you enjoy yourself.

06:00.070 --> 06:01.450
Oh, so sorry.

06:01.450 --> 06:02.960
It's an old habit.

06:02.960 --> 06:03.920
Huh?

06:04.260 --> 06:06.700
You have quite a well-trained butt.

06:06.700 --> 06:09.270
You're not just an ordinary maid, 
are you, young lady?

06:09.270 --> 06:10.890
Grandfather!

06:10.890 --> 06:13.240
We are not in Lestia!

06:13.240 --> 06:15.350
How many times have I asked 
you to refrain from that?!

06:17.870 --> 06:18.980
I'm sorry!

06:18.980 --> 06:20.270
He's, well...

06:20.270 --> 06:22.860
Just think of it as an old man's muscle spasm!

06:23.160 --> 06:26.420
Ah... I'm sure it must be a lot of trouble.

06:26.420 --> 06:28.950
<i>Though, this grandfather of hers 
really is something else.</i>

06:29.470 --> 06:32.420
<i>Lapis-san was a member of a spy agency.</i>

06:32.420 --> 06:35.660
<i>She wouldn't let anyone 
sneak up behind her so easily.</i>

06:35.660 --> 06:39.320
<i>I supposed that's an adventurer 
of the highest rank for you.</i>

06:39.320 --> 06:42.410
<i>Or maybe he's just a pervy old man.</i>

06:42.410 --> 06:43.600
Touya.

06:44.130 --> 06:48.090
About the sightseeing I mentioned earlier...

06:48.490 --> 06:54.420
I heard rumors that Brunhild had some 
artifacts that are giant soldiers—

06:54.420 --> 06:58.930
ancient relics that people 
can ride in and pilot.

06:59.930 --> 07:01.460
I see.

07:01.460 --> 07:05.540
I think it would be faster to show you 
in person than it would be to explain.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.900
These are the Frame Gears.

07:12.310 --> 07:15.330
They're one of our trump cards 
for fighting the Phrase.

07:15.330 --> 07:16.800
The Phrase...

07:17.290 --> 07:19.580
Those crystalline monsters, right?

07:21.870 --> 07:22.980
Storage.

07:24.750 --> 07:27.210
Monica, go ahead and 
show them how it operates.

07:27.210 --> 07:29.420
Roger that, Master!

07:40.030 --> 07:41.620
Incredible...

07:42.350 --> 07:47.110
These... Frame Gears. How many 
of them do you currently possess?

07:47.110 --> 07:49.820
Including this one, a little over a dozen.

07:49.820 --> 07:55.280
And what do you intend to do with 
such forces, Grand Duke of Brunhild?

07:55.620 --> 07:57.700
The Phrase are beings that once destroyed

07:57.700 --> 08:00.620
the ancient civilization 
that existed in this world.

08:00.620 --> 08:05.000
And now, there is a possibility that 
tragedy might come to repeat itself.

08:06.000 --> 08:10.980
I don't know whether a mass assault 
of Phrase will happen in the near future.

08:11.470 --> 08:13.450
But if we have no means of fighting back,

08:13.450 --> 08:15.490
we'll just be crushed underfoot.

08:15.490 --> 08:19.060
That's the reason I've brought 
back the Frame Gears.

08:20.110 --> 08:23.230
Of course, I have no intention 
of invading any other nation.

08:23.230 --> 08:27.650
It's also possible I might lend 
them out to our allied nations

08:27.650 --> 08:31.250
to help deal with giant monsters 
or natural disasters like landslides.

08:32.030 --> 08:33.650
Hypothetically,

08:33.650 --> 08:39.490
if Lestia were to ally with you as well, 
would we be able to borrow these?

08:39.900 --> 08:42.620
So long as you don't use them 
for war or anything illegal.

08:44.320 --> 08:47.860
One of my reasons for visiting Brunhild

08:47.860 --> 08:51.760
was to build friendly relations 
between our nations.

08:51.760 --> 08:56.530
I would have to speak with my son, our 
current king, before joining your alliance,

08:56.530 --> 08:58.350
but I see no reason he'd be opposed.

08:58.350 --> 09:01.200
We'd also be delighted to have you on board,

09:01.200 --> 09:04.060
though I'd need to hold a summit 
of the other member nations first.

09:08.360 --> 09:09.480
Um...

09:11.170 --> 09:15.530
Would you please listen to my 
request next, Your Royal Highness?

09:15.530 --> 09:17.490
What request?

09:17.490 --> 09:21.330
I want to fight the strongest 
warrior in your country!

09:21.900 --> 09:22.890
Sakura.

09:53.730 --> 09:55.190
That's enough!

09:57.150 --> 09:59.220
That was an enjoyable match.

09:59.220 --> 10:01.990
His Royal Highness has wonderful knights.

10:01.990 --> 10:05.000
I'm not a member of the knights.

10:05.000 --> 10:07.250
I'm Touya-dono's fiancée.

10:07.250 --> 10:09.120
Fiancée?

10:09.120 --> 10:11.020
We're engaged to be wed.

10:12.020 --> 10:17.300
You already have plans to wed another?

10:17.300 --> 10:20.700
Huh? Oh, yes, that's right.

10:20.700 --> 10:23.170
Though, due to Queen Yuel's pregnancy,

10:23.170 --> 10:27.160
my engagements to Yumina and Lu 
haven't been made public yet.

10:27.160 --> 10:29.650
Yumina? Lu?

10:29.650 --> 10:32.470
The princesses of Belfast and Regulus.

10:32.470 --> 10:35.730
They're both engaged to Touya-dono, too.

10:35.730 --> 10:37.190
Wh-What?!

10:37.190 --> 10:39.650
Y-You're engaged to three whole women?!

10:39.650 --> 10:41.930
To be precise, it's six.

10:41.930 --> 10:43.250
Six?!

10:44.400 --> 10:47.480
What do I do?

10:47.480 --> 10:49.390
I didn't expect this...

10:49.390 --> 10:50.830
No, I can still...

10:50.830 --> 10:54.170
Time for the older sister to step in!

10:54.170 --> 10:55.530
You scared me to death!

10:55.530 --> 10:56.810
You there!

10:56.810 --> 10:58.120
You're in love, aren't you?

10:58.120 --> 10:58.670
Huh?!

10:58.670 --> 11:01.160
Wh-What are you talking about?!

11:01.160 --> 11:03.390
L-Love?! No way!

11:03.390 --> 11:06.850
And the object of your love is Touya, isn't it?

11:07.830 --> 11:09.550
That's... That's not true!

11:09.550 --> 11:10.400
Huh?

11:10.950 --> 11:13.340
We've only ever met twice.

11:13.340 --> 11:15.620
You're as popular as ever, I see.

11:15.620 --> 11:17.780
Your big sis is proud of you.

11:18.180 --> 11:20.760
Hilde-dono, you love Touya-dono, then?

11:21.610 --> 11:24.830
No, um... Well, you see...

11:25.280 --> 11:30.190
I never expected him to be 
engaged to you, so... well...

11:30.190 --> 11:32.560
Um, I'm sorry.

11:32.560 --> 11:34.210
I'm causing you trouble, aren't I?

11:34.210 --> 11:35.400
Not at all.

11:35.400 --> 11:38.440
I was once in the same 
position you're in now,

11:38.440 --> 11:40.550
so I understand how you feel.

11:40.550 --> 11:41.720
Huh?

11:41.720 --> 11:44.830
When Touya-dono first became 
engaged to Yumina-dono,

11:44.830 --> 11:47.260
I was just one of his companions.

11:47.260 --> 11:50.000
I couldn't tell him how I felt,

11:50.000 --> 11:51.980
and I just kept it locked away in my heart.

11:52.360 --> 11:57.360
Though both Touya-dono and 
Yumina-dono accepted me.

11:57.360 --> 11:59.440
They did?

11:59.440 --> 12:04.450
So you should become engaged 
to Touya-dono, too, Hilde-dono!

12:04.450 --> 12:05.660
What?!

12:07.410 --> 12:10.160
U-Um, I...

12:10.160 --> 12:12.870
I will! I'll become the seventh!

12:12.870 --> 12:14.060
Huh?!

12:14.750 --> 12:16.840
This is getting exciting!

12:18.290 --> 12:21.210
Then I'll have to introduce 
you to everyone later.

12:22.240 --> 12:25.430
Y-Yes! Thank you, Yae!

12:25.740 --> 12:27.920
Wait, wait, wait! This isn't that simple!

12:27.920 --> 12:29.940
I've heard everything.

12:30.390 --> 12:34.320
However, I won't allow 
that marriage so easily.

12:34.320 --> 12:35.760
Grandfather?!

12:37.480 --> 12:40.350
You have to demonstrate 
a certain degree of resolve

12:40.350 --> 12:42.740
to marry the princess of our Knight Kingdom.

12:42.740 --> 12:45.440
Huh? Is this sequence of events

12:45.440 --> 12:48.990
going to lead to him saying, 
"Defeat me if you want to marry her"?

12:50.370 --> 12:52.000
You'll have to fight me!

12:52.000 --> 12:53.750
<i>Bingo.</i>

12:54.370 --> 12:56.630
Try and prove you can best me in combat,

12:56.630 --> 12:57.750
Hilde!

12:57.750 --> 12:59.350
Yes, Grandfather.

13:03.750 --> 13:04.970
Huh?

13:10.840 --> 13:14.810
Now, anyone opposed to Touya's 
engagement to Princess Hildegard,

13:14.810 --> 13:18.650
the first princess of the Knight Kingdom 
of Lestia, please raise your hand.

13:23.170 --> 13:28.070
Right. We unanimously agree to accept 
Princess Hildegard as a fellow wife.

13:29.920 --> 13:32.270
We pray you'll be a good wife 
who supports our husband with us,

13:32.270 --> 13:34.370
and a good mother one day.

13:34.370 --> 13:36.590
Thank you so much!

13:36.590 --> 13:38.720
I'll work myself to the bone 
to make that happen!

13:38.720 --> 13:42.630
Th-Though, are you sure you 
can accept someone like me?

13:42.630 --> 13:47.570
You're a splendid princess who's earnest 
and works hard for the sake of her people.

13:47.570 --> 13:49.350
There's no problem at all.

13:49.350 --> 13:50.680
That's...

13:50.680 --> 13:54.410
Besides, I think this is a good opportunity.

13:54.410 --> 13:58.020
Yumina and I are both princesses, 
but we're from Western nations.

13:58.020 --> 14:01.980
However, if an Eastern princess like you 
were to become engaged to him,

14:01.980 --> 14:05.130
it would mean we have connections 
in both East and West,

14:05.130 --> 14:06.740
and we would have nothing to fear.

14:07.300 --> 14:11.580
So that means it's time for romance talk now!

14:11.580 --> 14:13.330
Sister-in-Law Karen?

14:13.330 --> 14:16.080
I want to hear every little detail!

14:16.080 --> 14:20.210
Hilde, when and how did you 
fall in love with Touya?

14:20.210 --> 14:21.210
Huh?

14:21.210 --> 14:22.590
I want to hear that, too!

14:23.920 --> 14:25.760
Spill it already!

14:27.520 --> 14:29.600
Th-Then by your leave...

14:29.600 --> 14:33.450
It started when I faced a monster that 
repelled both sword and magic in Lestia.

14:33.450 --> 14:37.740
I was under attack by the Phrase, 
and I had just succumbed to despair

14:37.740 --> 14:42.560
when His Royal Highness dashingly appeared 
and saved me in the blink of an eye,

14:42.560 --> 14:43.490
and I'm so gratefu—

14:43.490 --> 14:45.400
No, that's not what I mean!

14:45.400 --> 14:46.020
Huh?

14:46.020 --> 14:48.490
I don't want some formal retelling.

14:48.490 --> 14:53.330
I want to hear about what made you 
blush or made your eyes sparkle!

14:53.330 --> 14:56.700
What did you think when you first saw Touya?

14:57.800 --> 14:59.520
"What a strong man."

14:59.520 --> 15:01.610
I asked the wrong question.

15:01.610 --> 15:06.930
When you first saw Touya, 
how did he look in your eyes?

15:06.930 --> 15:08.510
In my eyes?

15:11.370 --> 15:12.590
His Royal Highness...

15:13.340 --> 15:19.810
Touya was dazzling, and it seemed like 
the space around him was just so bright...

15:19.810 --> 15:22.140
That's what Sister-in-Law was talking about!

15:22.140 --> 15:23.250
So then what?

15:23.250 --> 15:25.360
What did you think of Touya then?

15:26.290 --> 15:26.940
He...

15:26.940 --> 15:28.400
He...?

15:28.400 --> 15:32.400
He... was so cool.

15:34.820 --> 15:37.250
That's what I wanted to hear!

15:37.250 --> 15:39.110
Now this is romance talk!

15:39.110 --> 15:42.990
So that's when you fell in love 
with Touya at first sight!

15:42.990 --> 15:44.340
Love at first sight?!

15:44.340 --> 15:45.250
W-Was it?

15:45.250 --> 15:46.290
Indeed, indeed!

15:46.290 --> 15:49.260
And it's your first love, too!

15:50.790 --> 15:51.970
How lovely!

15:51.970 --> 15:54.180
So what happened after that?!

15:54.180 --> 15:55.800
A-After that...

15:59.270 --> 16:01.640
I was constantly thinking about Touya,

16:01.640 --> 16:04.900
and I felt this pressure deep in my chest.

16:04.900 --> 16:07.320
I know what you mean!

16:08.300 --> 16:13.330
S-So then, when I heard my grandfather 
talk about heading to Brunhild

16:13.330 --> 16:16.210
in order to see what kind of man 
Touya was for himself,

16:16.210 --> 16:19.540
I thought, "What, without me? 
That's not fair!"

16:19.540 --> 16:22.910
So then you forced your way into 
coming here with the previous king?

16:22.910 --> 16:26.630
That just proves how much you love Touya!

16:29.810 --> 16:32.330
That's it! That's it! Keep going!

16:32.330 --> 16:36.020
You're making my skin soft and smooth 
on top of healing my shoulders!

16:36.020 --> 16:38.720
I hope you can become 
his official fiancée soon

16:38.720 --> 16:41.250
and be even more lovey-dovey together!

16:41.250 --> 16:42.930
Though to do that,

16:42.930 --> 16:46.520
you'll need to first win a match 
against the previous king.

16:46.520 --> 16:48.360
Do you think you can win?

16:50.340 --> 16:54.180
My chances of beating Grandfather 
in battle are one in ten...

16:54.180 --> 16:56.720
no, even less than that.

16:57.270 --> 16:59.580
Frankly, I think it will be difficult.

16:59.580 --> 17:01.860
It'll be all right, Hilde.

17:01.860 --> 17:06.260
Yes. Our husband is really strong 
in situations like this!

17:06.260 --> 17:09.420
I'm sure he'll come up 
with several good plans.

17:09.420 --> 17:13.010
Though those good plans 
might not play by the rules.

17:13.950 --> 17:15.930
Looks like they're having fun over there.

17:15.930 --> 17:17.890
What are they talking about?

17:19.040 --> 17:23.020
Well, something you might find 
yourself involved in someday, too.

17:25.530 --> 17:26.190
What's wrong?!

17:26.190 --> 17:29.270
Is that the extent of your 
feelings for the Grand Duke?!

17:29.270 --> 17:32.730
No! They're much more than this!

17:33.040 --> 17:34.870
He's strong.

17:34.870 --> 17:36.430
He wields his sword like a knight,

17:36.430 --> 17:39.580
but I can sense the intensity 
of many fierce battles behind it.

17:39.580 --> 17:41.120
She's holding her own, though, isn't she?

17:41.120 --> 17:44.510
That's because she's focused 
entirely on defense.

17:44.510 --> 17:47.310
But she can't win like that.

17:47.310 --> 17:49.980
Eventually her guard will 
be broken, and she'll fall.

17:52.000 --> 17:55.240
I think she can turn it around 
in one shot if she gets an opening.

17:55.240 --> 17:58.680
But will he give her that opening?

17:58.680 --> 18:02.130
Even if he is fighting his 
weaker granddaughter...

18:02.130 --> 18:04.980
He won't, but I'll make him.

18:05.870 --> 18:07.270
Get it?

18:07.600 --> 18:08.350
Huh?

18:12.710 --> 18:13.480
Mirage!

18:28.510 --> 18:29.520
Yes!

18:29.970 --> 18:31.180
Touya.

18:31.180 --> 18:31.880
What?

18:31.880 --> 18:34.640
Who was that woman wearing 
a string for a swimsuit

18:34.640 --> 18:37.470
that I saw behind Hilde for just a moment?

18:37.760 --> 18:38.590
Huh?

18:43.300 --> 18:44.510
I won!

18:44.510 --> 18:47.220
I won, Touya!

18:47.220 --> 18:48.980
I did it!

18:48.980 --> 18:50.300
Y-Yeah!

18:53.720 --> 18:57.360
Now I can marry you, too!

18:57.360 --> 19:01.070
I'm painfully stricken by my own immaturity.

19:02.780 --> 19:04.100
Cure Heal.

19:06.400 --> 19:08.130
Still, a loss is a loss.

19:08.130 --> 19:10.790
I've already assessed your resolve.

19:10.790 --> 19:12.290
I'll allow the engagement.

19:12.290 --> 19:16.960
From now on, strive to be a knight 
of Brunhild instead of Lestia.

19:17.630 --> 19:19.420
Grandfather...

19:20.130 --> 19:24.030
Touya, my granddaughter may 
only be good at wielding a sword,

19:24.030 --> 19:27.270
but I hope you'll take care of her 
as long as you both shall live.

19:28.120 --> 19:30.350
I will, rest assured.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.700
Now, then.

19:31.700 --> 19:35.070
Who was that lady before in the swimsuit?

19:35.070 --> 19:36.610
One more time!

19:36.610 --> 19:40.630
I want to burn that image 
into my eyes one more time!

19:40.630 --> 19:41.530
Swimsuit?

19:41.530 --> 19:44.060
Uh, Your Majesty,

19:41.530 --> 19:44.800
Where? Where is she?!

19:44.060 --> 19:47.990
it wouldn't do to chat out here, 
so shall we go to another room?

19:47.990 --> 19:48.830
That's true!

19:48.830 --> 19:51.210
Then let's go, Touya!

19:52.500 --> 19:54.990
I can't believe he made an opening so easily.

19:54.990 --> 19:56.360
Men...

19:56.360 --> 19:58.340
It's irritating, isn't it, Sister?

19:58.340 --> 20:01.080
She had awfully big breasts, didn't she?

20:01.080 --> 20:04.820
I wonder if Touya prefers 
swimsuits like that.

20:06.390 --> 20:07.510
Once again...

20:08.030 --> 20:10.350
I hope we can be friends from now on.

20:14.110 --> 20:19.730
So, um, as the new one here, there are 
many questions I'd like to ask all of you.

20:19.730 --> 20:21.610
That's fine. What are they?

20:21.610 --> 20:25.910
What kind of people are Touya's parents?

20:25.910 --> 20:28.950
Now that we're engaged, 
I would like to greet them.

20:28.950 --> 20:31.380
Oh, that.

20:31.380 --> 20:34.460
Actually, we've never met them, either.

20:34.460 --> 20:38.460
Touya doesn't like to talk 
about himself very much.

20:38.460 --> 20:41.820
I wonder if he has some 
problems with his family...

20:41.820 --> 20:43.420
Bzzt.

20:43.420 --> 20:45.760
That's not the case.

20:46.050 --> 20:47.850
Sister Karen?

20:48.220 --> 20:50.130
It's just a little bit complicated,

20:50.130 --> 20:53.840
so it's hard for him to explain it to you all.

20:53.840 --> 20:56.160
I'm sure he'll tell you about it someday,

20:56.160 --> 20:58.210
so for now, just wait until he's ready.

20:59.610 --> 21:00.650
Sure...

21:01.460 --> 21:04.330
You want to know everything 
about the man you love!

21:04.330 --> 21:08.030
I really understand how 
you maidens in love feel!

21:08.030 --> 21:09.740
So, on that note...

21:10.120 --> 21:13.170
Big Sis here is going to share some 
confidential information about Touya

21:13.170 --> 21:15.460
with her cute little sisters-in-law!

21:15.820 --> 21:18.920
Wh-What kind of information?

21:20.260 --> 21:21.450
In short...

21:21.450 --> 21:25.090
The boy's first love from when he was a child!

21:25.090 --> 21:26.550
H-His first love?!

21:26.550 --> 21:28.010
Touya's?!

21:28.010 --> 21:29.260
You want to hear?

21:29.260 --> 21:30.560
Definitely!

21:32.430 --> 21:35.980
<i>I feel like this could be bad 
if I don't tell Master...</i>

21:36.360 --> 21:38.700
<i>Master? Master?</i>

21:39.180 --> 21:40.110
<i>Huh?</i>

21:40.110 --> 21:42.470
<i>I can't connect to him? Why?</i>

21:48.650 --> 21:50.500
<i>So that's what's going on.</i>

21:50.930 --> 21:54.630
<i>Master, please forgive me 
for not being strong enough.</i>

21:54.630 --> 21:55.430
<i>Time to sleep.</i>

21:55.430 --> 21:58.290
I'm just brimming with power now!

21:58.290 --> 22:01.330
This really was this season's 
best power spot for love!

22:01.330 --> 22:04.010
I'm going to have lots more fun here!

22:08.240 --> 22:09.590
Do you have a cold?

22:09.590 --> 22:14.520
No, that sneeze was probably caused by...

22:14.520 --> 22:16.060
Caused by...?

22:30.770 --> 22:33.790
Every day is bittersweet

22:33.790 --> 22:36.200
(Bubbly bubbly)

22:36.200 --> 22:41.630
I might still blush when 
your eyes are close up

22:42.860 --> 22:47.280
Our love affair goes around with 
the 1, 2, 3 beat of I, My, Me, Mine

22:47.280 --> 22:50.150
But "Look solely at me"

22:50.520 --> 22:56.280
Is something I can't say; 
I want you to notice my jealousy

22:57.560 --> 23:00.210
My hero glimpsed through a lens

23:00.210 --> 23:04.010
I want you to take everything, 
even your flawed kindness

23:04.010 --> 23:06.720
And fill me up with goodness even more

23:06.720 --> 23:09.390
(even more)

23:09.390 --> 23:12.230
Until I burst

23:12.230 --> 23:17.270
My heart races and aches deep 
within because I love you

23:17.270 --> 23:22.720
My love is rapidly rising, 
but, but, but, but

23:22.720 --> 23:26.510
I can't help that we're in another world

23:26.510 --> 23:31.600
Let's sing about this joyous occasion 
illuminated by the brilliant sun!

23:31.600 --> 23:33.630
"Together forever!"

23:33.630 --> 23:37.920
I may not be much, but I want you 
to hug me from time to time,

23:37.920 --> 23:39.520
And if you're far away, that's okey-dokey

23:39.520 --> 23:42.010
We'll live happily ever after!
